                                "sense_id": "806d7556-b9c1-333d-aad1-a2556363783e",
                                "text": "He had a nasty face though, the boy considered, and looked like a bounder because he had pimples, a swelly nose, a loud voice, and a swanky manner. The boy disapproved of him wholly."
